summary: The file-manager panel type

!! Commands

* ``file-manager:activate`` — File manager: go into the folder / show the file (here / other / new)
* ``file-manager:select`` — File manager: change the checked multi-selection (toggle / all / none)
* ``file-manager:toggle`` — File manager: toggle a view flag (root constraint / hidden dot-entries / sort by watch activity / sort by operations written)

!! Generic commands

Provides ``refresh``, ``index``, ``count``, ``select``, ``entries``, ``descend``, ``parent``, ``root``, ``directory``, ``reveal``, ``paths`` to [[Generic panel commands]].
